OL,3,GNEWSACity region's public transport
OL,4,A'decade or so' behind London
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester is "a decade or so
OL,7,Fbehind" London when it comes to public
OL,8,Ftransport, the city region's active
OL,9,Ftravel commissioner has said.
OL,11,FDame Sarah Storey suggested Greater
OL,12,FManchester was playing catch-up with
OL,13,Fthe capital and other European cities
OL,14,Fbecause it was overly reliant on cars
OL,15,Fover trams, buses and bikes.
OL,17,FParalympic Games gold medallist Storey
OL,18,Fadded: "People here are driving because
OL,19,Fthey feel they don't have any other
OL,20,Fchoice. It's the work of the Bee
OL,21,FNetwork to shift that, but change does
OL,22,Ftake time."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
